version: 1.0.0
abstract: "Controlled historical abstract-loss experiments and separately labelled post-confirmation checks. Includes original numerical outputs, configurations, seeds, scientific code and portable reporting scripts. Per-file scope: MIT for original Python code/tests; CC BY 4.0 for own non-text data/configuration/provenance/documentation, as defined by LICENSE and manifests/license_scope.csv. These are not alternative licenses for the same files. The materials contain no source text, embedding arrays or model weights."
